  "title": "Tizeti’s 2022 Year in Review",
  "summary": "What a year 2022 has been! While 2022 was better than the previous two years, with better growth post the COVID-19 pandemic, this growth was subdued, due to rising inflation, high-interest rates, debts, as well as the Russia-Ukraine war and its impact on food prices in the world’s most food-insecure region. It is possibly because of the changing times that […]",
